<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-reported-provenance> <urn:usf:predicate:semanticStage> <urn:usf:stage:validation> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-reported-provenance> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Validate closed v2 event shape and facts, including bounded nonsecret identifiers and text, actual UTC instants and safe arithmetic. A token/cache/cost fact requires consistent nonnull source/evidence identity to expose its values as reported; mismatched or missing provenance is refused or reported unknown, never repaired. Keep provider cache tokens, semantic cache facts, observed cost and estimated cost separate. Preserve currency/evidence-kind groups if exposed; never infer charged cost, active model time, cache hit rates, or authenticity from equality or hashes." <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-reported-provenance> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-selection> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "job-lifecycle-reader-selection" <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-selection> <urn:usf:predicate:requirementSeverity> <urn:usf:requirement-severity:blocking> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-selection> <urn:usf:predicate:semanticStage> <urn:usf:stage:validation> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-selection> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Only explicit metrics summary --input .usf/metrics/NAME.jsonl or bounded stdin may select an all-v2 lifecycle report. Preserve default events.jsonl and all v1 views/outputs. Reject mixed v1/v2, invalid v2 records and unsupported v2 views or filters without raw payload output; no accidental schema fallback. Keep current private owner/symlink/size/input boundaries. Maximum input 8 MiB and 100000 records, result rows at most the caller max-items from 1 through 100; truncation and omitted groups remain explicit." <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-selection> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
