<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:semanticStage> <urn:usf:stage:validation> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-reader-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Actual-command private-input fixtures cover valid v2 and unchanged v1, replay/reordering/conflicting terminals, wall-clock rollback/cross-domain refusal, null identities, negative/unsafe/mismatched duration, forged acceptance, missing/changed provenance, parent cycles/unaccounted overlaps, unsupported views/mixed schemas, bounds and report shape. Preserve current boundary/error classifications and ordinary candidate/check/integration flow." <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-reader> .
